---

<Layout
  title="Kit Estetici e Styling d'Epoca Alfa 156 | Cuore Sportivo Archive"
  description="L'archivio fotografico e documentale completo di tutti i kit estetici d'epoca per Alfa Romeo 156 da alfa156.net: Cadamuro, Novitec, Zender, Autodelta e Lester."
  currentPath="/styling"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-alfa-red-600">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">Styling</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pb-8 mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
        <span class="lang-it">I Diversi Kit Estetici per Alfa Romeo 156</span>
        <span class="lang-en">The Different Styling Kits for Alfa Romeo 156</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        <span class="lang-it">
          <em>"Credo che saremo tutti d'accordo sul fatto che l'Alfa 156 sia una delle auto più belle presenti sulle autostrade di oggi. Ma ci sarà sempre chi desidera quel tocco in più per rendere la propria auto ancora più speciale. Questa pagina è per voi!"</em> — <strong>Anders</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          <em>"I think we will all agree that the Alfa 156 is one of the best looking cars on the motorways today. But there are always some who just need the little extra to make their car even more special. This page is for you!"</em> — <strong>Anders</strong>
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Kits Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-14">
      {stylingKits.map((kit) => (
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs hover:border-alfa-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-alfa-red-50 dark:bg-alfa-red-950 text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400">
                <span class="lang-it">{kit.countryIt}</span>
                <span class="lang-en">{kit.countryEn}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-400">
                <span class="lang-it">Kit d'epoca</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Period kit</span>
              </span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
              {kit.name}
            </h2>

            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 mb-5 leading-relaxed">
              <span class="lang-it">{kit.descIt}</span>
              <span class="lang-en">{kit.descEn}</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Thumbnails -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-alfa-metal-100 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
            {kit.images.map((img) => (
              <div
                class="group relative cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-700 bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-950"
                data-lightbox-trigger
                data-img-src={img.src}
                data-img-title={`${kit.name} - ${img.alt}`}
              >
                <img
                  src={img.src}
                  alt={img.alt}
                  class="w-full h-28 sm:h-32 object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity flex items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="text-white text-xs font-mono font-bold">
                    <span class="lang-it">🔍 Ingrandisci</span>
                    <span class="lang-en">🔍 Enlarge</span>
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

  </div>

  <Lightbox />
</Layout>
